- Prometheus StatsD exporter (image prom/statsd-exporter)
- Redis exporter (image oliver006/redis_exporter)
- PostgreSQL exporter (images prometheuscommunity/postgres-exporter and
  quay.io/prometheuscommunity/postgres-exporter)
- Prometheus JMX exporter, Bitnami image (image bitnami/jmx-exporter)
- Jaeger (image jaegertracing/all-in-one)
- OpenTelemetry Collector (image otel/opentelemetry-collector)
- BusyBox (image busybox, Helm init container)

